# Pending

- Validate clean build/install/runtime on Windows/D3D12, macOS/Metal and more GPUs.
- Before distributing binaries, prepare matching dependency notices and FFmpeg
  source/build information. The current library distribution is source-only.
- Measure CPU recording, GPU work and transfers separately before optimizing.
  Keep a change only when the same workload and quality show a repeatable benefit.
- Exact median is slow at large radii: 12 MP takes 25.8 s at r100 and 69.3 s at
  r500 (r2: 69 ms). Work is bounded, so the device survives, but it is not
  interactive. Details in benchmarks/native/filters.md.
- Brush/smudge stroke continuation replays snapshots exactly, so its cost grows
  with the accumulated samples of a stroke; bound or checkpoint it.
- Validate the browser (WebGPU) build end to end; only native Linux/Vulkan is
  verified (STATUS.md).

New operations need a public contract, implementation, focused correctness checks
and an example in `examples/examples.js`. Keep usage explanations with that example.
Document models, application UI, history and file-format projects belong to consumers.
